    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aeafad9c96c8942ec1740c3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有关英国，有关中国，每个月都会发生很多事，月底月初，我们把最近发生的大事小情和争议话题盘点一锅烩。</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 秋季预算案出炉，降开支促消费都是小打小闹？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a> 英国政府号召民众囤积物资备战备荒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1753">29:13</a> 时隔25年英国人再夺金球奖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a> 消费入座合情合理，英国有没有类似规定？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3072">51:12</a> 牛津街变成步行街初体验</span></p><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><p><span>Tom｜Jerry｜发癫的肖恩</span></p><p><span>【制作人】</span></p><p><span>小新</span></p><p><span>【强烈推荐】</span></p><p><span>主播Tom个人solo节目</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66e72b813a5ff0a0cab4bb74" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66e72b813a5ff0a0cab4bb74"><span>《艺心雕龙》</span></a><span>：艺术逼格拉满，艺术发烧友必听</span></p><p><span>主播Tom新节目</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1"><span>《完美五度》</span></a><span>：有娃中年人轻松聊古典音乐</span></p><p><span>主播Jerry个人solo节目</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226"><span>《杰叔看世界》</span></a><span>：杰叔陪你看世界热点政经时事</span></p>]]></description>
