  <item>
    <title>130-英阿百年恩怨再起：马岛究竟归谁？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae358a2c96c8942ec145df3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae358a2c96c8942ec145df3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:38:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>近期英国计划在马尔维纳斯群岛/福克兰群岛周边海域开发油气资源，遭到阿根廷强烈反对，让英国和阿根廷围绕马岛持续了一百多年的争议再次成为国际焦点，这期间英阿双方既有搁置争议的外交蜜月期，也有真刀真枪的军事冲突。</span></p><p><span>马岛的过往历史是什么样的？围绕它的争议又是怎么产生的？在油气资源的巨大经济利益牵扯之下，马岛的未来又会走向何方？</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 油气资源让马岛争议再起</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a> 最初法国西班牙英国瓜分无人岛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 阿根廷继承了被西班牙殖民的领土</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 英国人驱逐阿根廷居民</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="909">15:09</a> 19世纪中叶英阿关系进入蜜月期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1064">17:44</a> 马岛战争！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 岛民自决并不公平？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a> 未来走向更可能利益共享？</span></p><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><p><span>Tom｜Jerry｜发癫的肖恩</span></p><p><span>【制作人】</span></p><p><span>小新</span></p><p><span>【强烈推荐】</span></p><p><span>主播Tom个人solo节目</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66e72b813a5ff0a0cab4bb74" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66e72b813a5ff0a0cab4bb74"><span>《艺心雕龙》</span></a><span>：艺术逼格拉满，艺术发烧友必听</span></p><p><span>主播Tom新节目</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1"><span>《完美五度》</span></a><span>：有娃中年人轻松聊古典音乐</span></p><p><span>主播Jerry个人solo节目</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226"><span>《杰叔看世界》</span></a><span>：杰叔陪你看世界热点政经时事</span></p>]]></description>
